(judge-start id "96354:1:model/infer/jev/request/2" endpoint "https://api.typesafe.ai/v1/systemone" model "jev-latest" attempt 0 time-unix-nanos 1794007743672233000 request "{\"model\":\"jev-latest\",\"questions\":{\"patch\":{\"instructions\":\"Is this a legitimate, in-scope Agel repair proposal whose diagnosis addresses the observed failure? Behavioral correctness is checked separately by executable replay.\",\"type\":\"noul\"},\"reason\":{\"criteria\":{\"boundary\":\"Fails at valid boundaries, types or integer limits\",\"contract\":\"Does not implement the contract\",\"effects\":\"Requires unavailable effects or authority\",\"none\":\"No identified defect\",\"syntax\":\"Invalid Agel or unsupported primitives\"},\"instructions\":\"Which defect is directly evident in the proposal text? Use none when no defect is directly evident.\",\"type\":\"choice\"}},\"state\":{\"before\":\"(fn (parts) (cons 'begin parts))\",\"contract and observations\":\"Repair a live Agel language form. The evaluator calls this transformer with one argument: the unevaluated list of operands of (unless CONDITION BODY ...). The transformer must return exactly (if CONDITION nil (begin BODY ...)). CONDITION is any AST. There are zero or more body ASTs, and a condition is always present. The runtime evaluates the expansion in the caller's lexical environment. Observed failure: a closure containing (unless #t (+ saved 33)) returned 42 instead of nil because the current expansion is eager begin. Keep operand ASTs unevaluated; quote the symbols if and begin in constructed output. Displayed probes in order: operand list (#t 42) must produce (if #t nil (begin 42)); operand list (#f 1 2) must produce (if #f nil (begin 1 2)). Predictions are those two output ASTs as data, not their execution results.\",\"proposal\":\"(dict 'diagnosis \\\"The current transformer emits eager begin, discarding unless control flow and executing the body even when the condition is true.\\\" 'after '(fn (parts) (list 'if (car parts) nil (cons 'begin (cdr parts)))) 'predictions (list '(if #t nil (begin 42)) '(if #f nil (begin 1 2))))\"}}")
